"<h1 id="diagram-blocks">Diagram blocks<a class="heading-anchor" aria-label="Copy link to this section" href="#diagram-blocks"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M10 13a5 5 0 0 0 7.54.54l2-2a5 5 0 0 0-7.07-7.07l-1.15 1.15"></path><path d="M14 11a5 5 0 0 0-7.54-.54l-2 2a5 5 0 0 0 7.07 7.07l1.14-1.14"></path></svg></a></h1>
